This task is derived from CRUXEval (facebookresearch/cruxeval, commit 190faf16d175b5847b0af05d937872b1fb395942), function sample_736 of
data/cruxeval.jsonl. Changes for INIT's visible pool v1: the function is named replace_ws and placed in a small package (cleaner) with a helper module written fresh; the task adds a new function squeeze_ws (trimming, collapsing runs over the same six whitespace characters, keep_newlines) and keeps replace_ws; the hidden cases come from the new reference solution.

